DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
39397::$$$message_0272_0000_0000$$$::I'll go to the pool with Saber.[lr]::
39398::$$$message_0272_0000_0001$$$::Saber was looking forward to it, so I need to fulfill the promise as soon as I can.::
39399::$$$message_0272_0001_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
39400::$$$message_0272_0001_0001$$$::I stand in front of Saber's room.[lr]::
39401::$$$message_0272_0001_0002$$$::...Hmmm.[lr]::
39402::$$$message_0272_0001_0003$$$::W-when I think about it like this, isn't going to the pool with Saber a crazy idea?::
39403::$$$message_0272_0002_0000$$$::"[shock vmax=10 time=600 count=-3]Hrrk... It's okay, it's easy, calm down..."[lr]::
39404::$$$message_0272_0002_0001$$$::I take a deep breath and cool down the heat in my cheeks.[lr]::
39405::$$$message_0272_0002_0002$$$::I'll act natural and make it concise.[lr]::
39406::$$$message_0272_0002_0003$$$::Saber would be troubled if the one inviting her is flustered too.[lr]::
39407::$$$message_0272_0002_0004$$$::"All right... Hey Saber, can we talk for a bit?"::
39408::$$$message_0272_0003_0000$$$::"Y-[cacheimage storage=セイバー私服01e(中),i衛宮邸_セイバー部屋][wvl canskip=0 time=500][rep textoff=0 fliplr=0 storages=セイバー私服01e(中) time=100 flipud=0 poss=c bg=i衛宮邸_セイバー部屋 indexes=1000]yes.[lr]::
39409::$$$message_0272_0003_0001$$$::I-I have been waiting on that matter, so I shall gladly accept, Shirou."::
39410::$$$message_0272_0004_0000$$$::And...[lr]::
39411::$$$message_0272_0004_0001$$$::After ten minutes of flailing around like an idiot...[lr]::
39412::$$$message_0272_0004_0002$$$::Saber responded right away to the invitation that I was finally able to bring up.::
39413::$$$message_0272_0005_0000$$$::"I-I see. Sorry for making you wait.[lr]::
39414::$$$message_0272_0005_0001$$$::I'll be waiting in the living room then, so come when you're ready."[lr]::
39415::$$$message_0272_0005_0002$$$::"N-[cacheimage storage=セイバー私服05d(中),i衛宮邸_セイバー部屋][wvl canskip=0 time=500][rep force=1 textoff=0 fliplr=0 storages=セイバー私服05d(中) time=100 flipud=0 poss=c bg=i衛宮邸_セイバー部屋 indexes=1000 cleardash=1]no, I have been ready for a while now, so I am ready..."[lr]::
39416::$$$message_0272_0005_0003$$$::...Saber freezes for some reason there.[lr]::
39417::$$$message_0272_0005_0004$$$::It seems like she remembered something important.::
39418::$$$message_0272_0006_0000$$$::"Saber?"[lr]::
39419::$$$message_0272_0006_0001$$$::"No, I would like some time after all.[lr]::
39420::$$$message_0272_0006_0002$$$::P-please wait in the living room."[lr]::
39421::$$$message_0272_0006_0003$$$::"O-okay. I'll be waiting in the living room then."[lr]::
39422::$$$message_0272_0006_0004$$$::I get pushed by some odd willpower and go out into the hallway.[lr]::
39423::$$$message_0272_0006_0005$$$::...I wonder what Saber remembered.::
39424::$$$message_0272_0007_0000$$$::"Are you going to the pool with Saber? Good, you're finally taking action."[lr]::
39425::$$$message_0272_0007_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
39426::$$$message_0272_0007_0002$$$::"Oh, no Rider, don't go and get Sakura. Can you turn a blind eye for today?"::
39427::$$$message_0272_0008_0000$$$::"...[wait canskip=0 time=600][say storage=ctyex07_rad_0010 name=ライダー][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=ライダー私服04d(中)]Understood.[lr]::
39428::$$$message_0272_0008_0001$$$::You are right; it is a special occasion. I would think that you can get closer to each other if you go individually instead of having you go as a three."::
39429::$$$message_0272_0009_0000$$$::...Just like this, there are two devils in the living room that don't have anything to do.[lr]::
39430::$$$message_0272_0009_0001$$$::I half-listen to the conversation of the two who won't seem to get out of the living room no matter what, and prepare our lunches for twenty minutes.[lr]::
39431::$$$message_0272_0009_0002$$$::"Thank you for waiting, Shirou."[lr]::
39432::$$$message_0272_0009_0003$$$::The sliding door opens, and Saber appears.::
39433::$$$message_0272_0010_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
39434::$$$message_0272_0010_0001$$$::My mind goes blank with my face still raised.[lr]::
39435::$$$message_0272_0010_0002$$$::In response to her different appearance...[lr]::
39436::$$$message_0272_0010_0003$$$::"Ahhh! Yaaa! Hooo![lr]::
39437::$$$message_0272_0010_0004$$$::C-c-could those clothes be...!?"[lr]::
39438::$$$message_0272_0010_0005$$$::Fuji-nee pretty much speaks on my behalf.::
39439::$$$message_0272_0011_0000$$$::"Yes, this is what you bought for me.[lr]::
39440::$$$message_0272_0011_0001$$$::I figured that I might as well use this opportunity to spend today in this."::
39441::$$$message_0272_0012_0000$$$::Saber smiles.[lr]::
39442::$$$message_0272_0012_0001$$$::Fuji-nee jumps around in joy.[lr]::
39443::$$$message_0272_0012_0002$$$::Rider is staring like she's jealous and somewhat sulking.[lr]::
39444::$$$message_0272_0012_0003$$$::"..."[lr]::
39445::$$$message_0272_0012_0004$$$::...Dammit, I missed my chance to get emotional over it.::
39446::$$$message_0272_0013_0000$$$::"H-how do I look, Shirou? It does not seem as if there will be any battles today, so I am thinking of going like this."[lr]::
39447::$$$message_0272_0013_0001$$$::"I-I think it's fine. I-i-i-it looks really good on you too."[lr]::
39448::$$$message_0272_0013_0002$$$::"I am glad. I also think that they are very nice clothes."::
39449::$$$message_0272_0014_0000$$$::"Oof..."[lr]::
39450::$$$message_0272_0014_0001$$$::I can't help but turn red from Saber's smile.[lr]::
39451::$$$message_0272_0014_0002$$$::...This is going to be a long journey.[lr]::
39452::$$$message_0272_0014_0003$$$::If I'm turning red just from Saber's outfit, then I might die at the pool...::
39453::$$$message_0272_0015_0000$$$::"We're heading out. Look after the house for me."[lr]::
39454::$$$message_0272_0015_0001$$$::"I got you. Leave it to me.[lr]::
39455::$$$message_0272_0015_0002$$$::Saber is in her long-awaited uniform too, so you can take it easy today.[lr]::
39456::$$$message_0272_0015_0003$$$::I can even make dinner in your place today and wait for your return!"::
39457::$$$message_0272_0016_0000$$$::Fuji-nee smiles in glee, full of enthusiasm.[lr]::
39458::$$$message_0272_0016_0001$$$::That consideration makes me really happy.[lr]::
39459::$$$message_0272_0016_0002$$$::"Okay, I'm counting on you, Rider. Make sure you don't let Fuji-nee in the kitchen no matter what."[lr]::
39460::$$$message_0272_0016_0003$$$::"I know, Shirou."[lr]::
39461::$$$message_0272_0016_0004$$$::"Guh!? Hey Shirou, what does that mean!?"::
39462::$$$message_0272_0017_0000$$$::"Thanks for waiting, Saber."[lr]::
39463::$$$message_0272_0017_0001$$$::"Shirou, that is going too far. It is understandable for Taiga to feel hurt."[lr]::
39464::$$$message_0272_0017_0002$$$::"Oof... W-well, I need to say it or else it'll be a catastrophe. That was for Fuji-nee's sake too[line len=2]"::
39465::$$$message_0272_0018_0000$$$::"What do you mean exactly by catastrophe?"[lr]::
39466::$$$message_0272_0018_0001$$$::"...You've experienced it before, Saber. It would be bringing in a new tragedy following the okonomiyaki bowl."[lr]::
39467::$$$message_0272_0018_0002$$$::Then when we come back, there'll be Sakura and the others lying on the floor like dead bodies.[lr]::
39468::$$$message_0272_0018_0003$$$::"...That was thoughtless of me. A tragedy like that cannot be allowed to occur again."[lr]::
39469::$$$message_0272_0018_0004$$$::Yeah, that's right. Lord have mercy on me.::
39470::$$$message_0272_0019_0000$$$::"By the way, it's your first time going to the pool, right?"[lr]::
39471::$$$message_0272_0019_0001$$$::"Yes. What kind of place is the pool?"[lr]::
39472::$$$message_0272_0019_0002$$$::"Huh? Saber, did you agree to go to the pool without knowing what it is?"[lr]::
39473::$$$message_0272_0019_0003$$$::"It is a place that you invited me to, so it is not the kind of place that I should hold malice towards."::
39474::$$$message_0272_0020_0000$$$::My pulse climbs at her trusting gaze.[lr]::
39475::$$$message_0272_0020_0001$$$::There's no way I can say that it's because I wanted to see Saber in a swimsuit at this point.::
39476::$$$message_0272_0021_0000$$$::"What happened, Shirou? Your face is red."[lr]::
39477::$$$message_0272_0021_0001$$$::"No, it's nothing."[lr]::
39478::$$$message_0272_0021_0002$$$::"That is not good, what if that means you are not feeling well? Illness infiltrates from letting your guard down."[lr]::
39479::$$$message_0272_0021_0003$$$::Oh, no, if you get that close, my feelings that just calmed down will flare right back up...!::
39480::$$$message_0272_0022_0000$$$::"N-[shock vmax=20 time=500 count=-4]n-no, I'm really fine!"[lr]::
39481::$$$message_0272_0022_0001$$$::"...I am glad."[lr]::
39482::$$$message_0272_0022_0002$$$::I take a deep breath and calm myself down.[lr]::
39483::$$$message_0272_0022_0003$$$::But... If she doesn't know what kind of place the pool is, then won't she be unprepared?[lr]::
39484::$$$message_0272_0022_0004$$$::She's carrying a big bag in one hand that she usually doesn't have, so I figured she has towels and her swimsuit in there.::
39485::$$$message_0272_0023_0000$$$::"Saber, what's in that bag?"[lr]::
39486::$$$message_0272_0023_0001$$$::"It's for the pool, of course."[lr]::
39487::$$$message_0272_0023_0002$$$::"What?"[lr]::
39488::$$$message_0272_0023_0003$$$::Didn't she just ask what kind of place the pool is?::
39489::$$$message_0272_0024_0000$$$::"Shirou, it seems as though there has been some kind of misunderstanding.[lr]::
39490::$$$message_0272_0024_0001$$$::Even I understand what a pool is. I meant that I do not know much about the place that you are taking me to."[lr]::
39491::$$$message_0272_0024_0002$$$::Oh, I see. I finally get it now.::
39492::$$$message_0272_0025_0000$$$::"Hm... Do you know what an indoor pool is?"[lr]::
39493::$$$message_0272_0025_0001$$$::"Does that mean that there is a pool inside a building?"[lr]::
39494::$$$message_0272_0025_0002$$$::"Yeah. A really big one... I think even the Einzbern Castle would fit inside."[lr]::
39495::$$$message_0272_0025_0003$$$::"T-there is a facility like that? And just for recreational purposes?"[lr]::
39496::$$$message_0272_0025_0004$$$::"Yeah. People here go all out for stuff like that."[lr]::
39497::$$$message_0272_0025_0005$$$::"Mrgh... [cacheimage storage=セイバーfd特殊04g(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=セイバーfd特殊04g(中)]I must set my heart on it then."::
39498::$$$message_0272_0026_0000$$$::We get to Shinto by bus.[lr]::
39499::$$$message_0272_0026_0001$$$::Saber was acting strange the last time we came, but not today.::
39500::$$$message_0272_0027_0000$$$::"Oh yeah. By the way, what kind of swimsuit did you buy, Saber?"[lr]::
39501::$$$message_0272_0027_0001$$$::"Wha[line len=2][cacheimage storage=セイバーfd特殊04d(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=500][chgfg textoff=0 storage=セイバーfd特殊04d(中) time=300]No, I was told to keep it a secret until I actually wear it."[lr]::
39502::$$$message_0272_0027_0002$$$::"I see. I have a hunch, but by who?"[lr]::
39503::$$$message_0272_0027_0003$$$::"Taiga. She said to surprise you and enjoy your reaction."::
39504::$$$message_0272_0028_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
39505::$$$message_0272_0028_0001$$$::Well, that's just rude.[lr]::
39506::$$$message_0272_0028_0002$$$::Whether it's a surprise or direct confrontation, I'm no match for Saber's swimsuit.::
39507::$$$message_0272_0029_0000$$$::In front of the locker room...[lr]::
39508::$$$message_0272_0029_0001$$$::I part with Saber, filled with high expectations.[lr]::
39509::$$$message_0272_0029_0002$$$::Of course I finish changing first since I'm a guy, and now I'm here waiting, but...::
39510::$$$message_0272_0030_0000$$$::"...I wonder if Saber is okay."[lr]::
39511::$$$message_0272_0030_0001$$$::Saber is of course valiant, but I get worried when I leave her alone in places like this.[lr]::
39512::$$$message_0272_0030_0002$$$::I wonder if I should've had someone come along with us like Tohsaka, Sakura, or Fuji-nee. It'd be a bit of a step back from what was promised, though.::
39513::$$$message_0272_0031_0000$$$::"...No, it would be more than worrisome if they came along... It's much more carefree with just the two of us."[lr]::
39514::$$$message_0272_0031_0001$$$::The Waku Waku Zabuun information board is in front of me.[lr]::
39515::$$$message_0272_0031_0002$$$::A whirlpool, a wave pool, a big water slide, a super high diving board, a pool for swimming races, and even a pool attraction that I couldn't begin to describe.::
39516::$$$message_0272_0032_0000$$$::"There's a lot to do here."[lr]::
39517::$$$message_0272_0032_0001$$$::We shouldn't get bored even if I take Saber around for the whole day.[lr]::
39518::$$$message_0272_0032_0002$$$::"Saber's taking a while... I think."[lr]::
39519::$$$message_0272_0032_0003$$$::I don't really come to the pool often, so I don't really know how long it takes for girls to get ready.::
39520::$$$message_0272_0033_0000$$$::[font italic=true]...Hm?[font italic=false][lr]::
39521::$$$message_0272_0033_0001$$$::I feel like I just saw a familiar figure out of the corner of my eye.[lr]::
39522::$$$message_0272_0033_0002$$$::No, there's no way he would be in a place like this. I must be seeing things.::
39523::$$$message_0272_0034_0000$$$::When I look around again, I see Saber hiding in the shadows.[lr]::
39524::$$$message_0272_0034_0001$$$::She's peering over here while attempting to hide half her body.::
39525::$$$message_0272_0035_0000$$$::"What are you doing, Saber?"[lr]::
39526::$$$message_0272_0035_0001$$$::"Nothing, Shirou... Um."[lr]::
39527::$$$message_0272_0035_0002$$$::"You can't do anything from over there. Come over here."::
39528::$$$message_0272_0036_0000$$$::Saber is hiding near the entrance of the girls' locker room, so people would think I'm a weirdo if I stared over there.[lr]::
39529::$$$message_0272_0036_0001$$$::Saber comes walking over timidly...[lr]::
39530::$$$message_0272_0036_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
39531::$$$message_0272_0036_0003$$$::She walks...over.::
39532::$$$message_0272_0037_0000$$$::I completely assumed that Saber would be wearing a one-piece swimsuit.[lr]::
39533::$$$message_0272_0037_0001$$$::I thought that she had chosen a modest swimsuit that matched her style.[lr]::
39534::$$$message_0272_0037_0002$$$::But, what appears is a provocative bikini that is the complete opposite of what I was expecting.[lr]::
39535::$$$message_0272_0037_0003$$$::To be honest, there's so much skin showing, I don't know where to look.::
39536::$$$message_0272_0038_0000$$$::"Um, Shirou. Is there something weird after all?"[lr]::
39537::$$$message_0272_0038_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
39538::$$$message_0272_0038_0002$$$::"Um, I have never worn something like this before, so I don't think it suits me."::
39539::$$$message_0272_0039_0000$$$::"...It's not weird. It suits you so well I can't even explain."[lr]::
39540::$$$message_0272_0039_0001$$$::That was the best that I could say.[lr]::
39541::$$$message_0272_0039_0002$$$::I want to say something more sensible, but I can only let out what I'm thinking.::
39542::$$$message_0272_0040_0000$$$::"...I am glad. If that is what you think, then I am not bothered by others looking."[lr]::
39543::$$$message_0272_0040_0001$$$::"..."::
39544::$$$message_0272_0041_0000$$$::"Hm? What is wrong, Shirou?"[lr]::
39545::$$$message_0272_0041_0001$$$::"Well...it's nothing, really."[lr]::
39546::$$$message_0272_0041_0002$$$::I'm about to pass out from the way that she is as bright as the sun.::
39547::$$$message_0272_0042_0000$$$::"Is that so? I hope it is not anemia."[lr]::
39548::$$$message_0272_0042_0001$$$::"Uh... No, I'll do my best. I can't quit just yet."::
39549::$$$message_0272_0043_0000$$$::"Shirou?"[lr]::
39550::$$$message_0272_0043_0001$$$::"No, don't worry about me.[lr]::
39551::$$$message_0272_0043_0002$$$::By the way, Saber, did you pick that swimsuit out yourself?"[lr]::
39552::$$$message_0272_0043_0003$$$::"Yes. I don't know much about swimsuits, so I left it up to Taiga and Sakura. We made it so that I would choose which I liked better out of the ones they picked.[lr]::
39553::$$$message_0272_0043_0004$$$::It's just..."[lr]::
39554::$$$message_0272_0043_0005$$$::She hesitates.::
39555::$$$message_0272_0044_0000$$$::"Huh? Did something happen?"[lr]::
39556::$$$message_0272_0044_0001$$$::"No. At first, I chose one that was a full one-piece swimsuit, but um... I thought that you would be more happy with the one I'm wearing now..."::
39557::$$$message_0272_0045_0000$$$::Saber looks up at me worriedly.[lr]::
39558::$$$message_0272_0045_0001$$$::I can't freeze like an idiot with her making a face like that.::
39559::$$$message_0272_0046_0000$$$::"...Yeah, I'm really happy."[lr]::
39560::$$$message_0272_0046_0001$$$::"...So am I. When you smile, it makes me so happy that I want to jump up and down."[lr]::
39561::$$$message_0272_0046_0002$$$::If it's about being happy, she can't beat me![lr]::
39562::$$$message_0272_0046_0003$$$::I want to reply that I want to start running, but I swallow my words since I feel like it would be an unproductive argument.::
39563::$$$message_0272_0047_0000$$$::"...All right. Where do you want to go then, Saber?"[lr]::
39564::$$$message_0272_0047_0001$$$::"I can't make a decision even if you ask me to. Please decide, Shirou."[lr]::
39565::$$$message_0272_0047_0002$$$::"I see. Then..."::
39566::$$$message_0272_0048_0000$$$::It's probably safest to not go on a slide or any scary rides first.[lr]::
39567::$$$message_0272_0048_0001$$$::There are ones that whirl or produce waves, but we should try a regular pool to start with.::
39568::$$$message_0272_0049_0000$$$::"U-um, Shirou."[lr]::
39569::$$$message_0272_0049_0001$$$::"Hm? Did you find somewhere you want to go?"[lr]::
39570::$$$message_0272_0049_0002$$$::"No, that is not it..."[lr]::
39571::$$$message_0272_0049_0003$$$::Huh? Saber seems to be uncomfortable.[lr]::
39572::$$$message_0272_0049_0004$$$::Though it isn't obvious, I see quite a lot of people looking in our direction when I look around.::
39573::$$$message_0272_0050_0000$$$::"Sorry, you don't like standing out, right? Why don't we move somewhere else for now?"[lr]::
39574::$$$message_0272_0050_0001$$$::"No, I was trying not to let myself get bothered by others looking, but... Yes, let's change the subject.[lr]::
39575::$$$message_0272_0050_0002$$$::This is sudden, but can you swim, Shirou?"[lr]::
39576::$$$message_0272_0050_0003$$$::"Yeah. Well, to an average extent."::
39577::$$$message_0272_0051_0000$$$::"Mrgh... T-that is quite dependable."[lr]::
39578::$$$message_0272_0051_0001$$$::"Oh. Saber, can you not swim?"[lr]::
39579::$$$message_0272_0051_0002$$$::"Yes, I am embarrassed to admit it, but probably not."[lr]::
39580::$$$message_0272_0051_0003$$$::"...Probably? Is your memory vague like Archer's?"::
39581::$$$message_0272_0052_0000$$$::"That is not it.[lr]::
39582::$$$message_0272_0052_0001$$$::...To be honest, Shirou, I've never been swimming.[lr]::
39583::$$$message_0272_0052_0002$$$::I have the protection of the Lady of the Lake, so I can walk on water without sinking. I always ran atop water instead of swimming on the battlefield."[lr]::
39584::$$$message_0272_0052_0003$$$::"Wha..."[lr]::
39585::$$$message_0272_0052_0004$$$::A shocking new truth.[lr]::
39586::$$$message_0272_0052_0005$$$::Saber is like a ninja; she can walk on water...!::
39587::$$$message_0272_0053_0000$$$::"E-even now?"[lr]::
39588::$$$message_0272_0053_0001$$$::"Yes. I can walk on water even if I don't try."[lr]::
39589::$$$message_0272_0053_0002$$$::...Wow. The King Arthur myth is as deep as it is wide.[lr]::
39590::$$$message_0272_0053_0003$$$::I wonder if it'd be possible for her to fly or use a stream of lava as a shower... Anyway, putting those delusions aside...::
39591::$$$message_0272_0054_0000$$$::"Protection from a fairy, huh? But that doesn't mean you can't go in water, right?"[lr]::
39592::$$$message_0272_0054_0001$$$::"Yes. I would not be able to take a bath if that were the case."[lr]::
39593::$$$message_0272_0054_0002$$$::Come to think of it, she's right.[lr]::
39594::$$$message_0272_0054_0003$$$::Saber was really taking a bath elegantly like a goddess that one time...::
39595::$$$message_0272_0055_0000$$$::...Oh no.[lr]::
39596::$$$message_0272_0055_0001$$$::I remember that quite vividly.::
39597::$$$message_0272_0056_0000$$$::"Shirou?"[lr]::
39598::$$$message_0272_0056_0001$$$::"Well..."[lr]::
39599::$$$message_0272_0056_0002$$$::I need to stay as calm as possible. I need to try not to remember it and focus only on the conversation.[lr]::
39600::$$$message_0272_0056_0003$$$::"So that means you've never swum in a river or lake then."::
39601::$$$message_0272_0057_0000$$$::"I've submerged myself before, but I don't have any experience actually swimming.[lr]::
39602::$$$message_0272_0057_0001$$$::Besides, I have never taken my clothes off in front of people ever since I became King."::
39603::$$$message_0272_0058_0000$$$::That's why Saber used the word "probably."[lr]::
39604::$$$message_0272_0058_0001$$$::She's never swum before, so she doesn't know if she can.::
39605::$$$message_0272_0059_0000$$$::"I am sorry. I should have mentioned that in the beginning."[lr]::
39606::$$$message_0272_0059_0001$$$::"No, you're not at fault. I'm the one who forced you to come in the first place."[lr]::
39607::$$$message_0272_0059_0002$$$::"No, [wvl][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-3]I was not forced to do anything.[lr]::
39608::$$$message_0272_0059_0003$$$::I was elated that you invited me, so it is my fault for forgetting to communicate that!"::
39609::$$$message_0272_0060_0000$$$::"Wait, you were elated too?"[lr]::
39610::$$$message_0272_0060_0001$$$::"Huh...? [cacheimage storage=セイバーfd特殊01g(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=700][chgfg textoff=0 time=100 storage=セイバーfd特殊01g(中)][cacheimage storage=セイバーfd特殊05g(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=500][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=セイバーfd特殊05g(中)]Oh, no, that was a figure of speech![lr]::
39611::$$$message_0272_0060_0002$$$::It was more like I was bracing myself for the unknown in front of me, instead of being excited!"[lr]::
39612::$$$message_0272_0060_0003$$$::She totally wants to go in the pool already.::
39613::$$$message_0272_0061_0000$$$::"All right, all right. Then, let's jump into the pool, Saber!"[lr]::
39614::$$$message_0272_0061_0001$$$::"...Oh. No, it's good to be in high spirits, but before that, Shirou..."[lr]::
39615::$$$message_0272_0061_0002$$$::"Hm? Should we eat before we swim?"::
39616::$$$message_0272_0062_0000$$$::"No, that is not it. [cacheimage storage=セイバーfd特殊01f(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 textoff=0 storage=セイバーfd特殊01f(中)]If it is all right with you, can you please teach me how to swim?"[lr]::
39617::$$$message_0272_0062_0001$$$::"How to swim?"::
39618::$$$message_0272_0063_0000$$$::"Yes. I thought that I might as well use this opportunity to learn so that it can help later."[lr]::
39619::$$$message_0272_0063_0001$$$::"I see... Yeah, you would be able to have more fun that way when you come next time."[lr]::
39620::$$$message_0272_0063_0002$$$::"Then, will you teach me?"::
39621::$$$message_0272_0064_0000$$$::"Of course. I'm always the one learning how to use a sword from you, so there's no need to hold back on asking me for anything."[lr]::
39622::$$$message_0272_0064_0001$$$::"All right. Then I will be depending on you, Shirou."[lr]::
39623::$$$message_0272_0064_0002$$$::"Leave it to me... Wait, you said, 'later.' Do you plan on coming again?"::
39624::$$$message_0272_0065_0000$$$::"Nothing's decided, but when we were shopping for swimsuits, Taiga said that we should all go together."[lr]::
39625::$$$message_0272_0065_0001$$$::"I see."[lr]::
39626::$$$message_0272_0065_0002$$$::"Yes. But, I am glad that I was able to come with you. I appreciate Taiga's consideration."::
39627::$$$message_0272_0066_0000$$$::"Yeah. I bet it would be hard for you to say that you've never swum before in front of everyone too."[lr]::
39628::$$$message_0272_0066_0001$$$::"Mrgh... That is not what I mean, Shirou."::
39629::$$$message_0272_0067_0000$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
39630::$$$message_0272_0067_0001$$$::"...Haah. I am not very smart myself, but I am nowhere near your level."[lr]::
39631::$$$message_0272_0067_0002$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
39632::$$$message_0272_0067_0003$$$::I admit that I'm slow, but when did we start competing to see who's more thickheaded?::
39633::$$$message_0272_0068_0000$$$::"...It is fine, never mind.[lr]::
39634::$$$message_0272_0068_0001$$$::Let us start practicing, Shirou."[lr]::
39635::$$$message_0272_0068_0002$$$::"Y-yeah. Will the practice pool over there be okay?"::
39636::$$$message_0272_0069_0000$$$::"Practice pool... They even have a place for that too?"[lr]::
39637::$$$message_0272_0069_0001$$$::"They do. I'm sure there are other people like you who come to practice swimming."[lr]::
39638::$$$message_0272_0069_0002$$$::However, I don't mention that it's mainly children who use it.::
39639::$$$message_0272_0070_0000$$$::"Umm, there are other pools that are like ones used for competitions, so it's not just exclusively devoted to having fun."::
39640::$$$message_0272_0071_0000$$$::"Ah... I see, there really is a wide variety.[lr]::
39641::$$$message_0272_0071_0001$$$::I bet there is no other water park that has this much. We should be grateful that such a rare place like this was built in Fuyuki."::
39642::$$$message_0272_0072_0000$$$::Saber is moved.[lr]::
39643::$$$message_0272_0072_0001$$$::...It awakens my desire to tease her... If she's surprised by this pool, I wonder how surprised she would be if I took her to that big amusement park in Tokyo.::
39644::$$$message_0272_0073_0000$$$::We get to the practice pool.[lr]::
39645::$$$message_0272_0073_0001$$$::Fortunately, there are no small children, and there's no one seriously practicing. We have the whole pool to ourselves.::
39646::$$$message_0272_0074_0000$$$::"Saber, you're not scared of water, right?"[lr]::
39647::$$$message_0272_0074_0001$$$::"I am not afraid, but...what do you mean by that?"[lr]::
39648::$$$message_0272_0074_0002$$$::"Well, there are apparently quite a lot of people who have a fear of water.[lr]::
39649::$$$message_0272_0074_0003$$$::In that case, we would have to start by putting your face in the water."::
39650::$$$message_0272_0075_0000$$$::"I do not have any problems. The water is nothing to be scared of. Yes, I shall even swim across Lochlann, infamous for its raging waves, if you wish."[lr]::
39651::$$$message_0272_0075_0001$$$::"That's a quick and specific answer. You aren't scared of anything anyway. That was a dumb question."::
39652::$$$message_0272_0076_0000$$$::"Mrgh. That is rude. Even I have things that I am scared of."[lr]::
39653::$$$message_0272_0076_0001$$$::"Wow! I wanna know. What is it? What are you scared of, Saber?"[lr]::
39654::$$$message_0272_0076_0002$$$::"...You seem overly excited, Shirou. Do you want to know my weaknesses that much?"::
39655::$$$message_0272_0077_0000$$$::"Of course. It's annoying that I'm the one protected by you. I want to at least know when I can protect you when I need to."[lr]::
39656::$$$message_0272_0077_0001$$$::Also, I want to find at least one thing I can tease her about.::
39657::$$$message_0272_0078_0000$$$::"A-ahem.[lr]::
39658::$$$message_0272_0078_0001$$$::Yes, we can talk about that later. Right now, it is time for swimming training! Now, Shirou, let us begin practicing!"[lr]::
39659::$$$message_0272_0078_0002$$$::"...Ugh. I promised to teach you, so I guess this is higher priority."::
39660::$$$message_0272_0079_0000$$$::We push through the water.[lr]::
39661::$$$message_0272_0079_0001$$$::I should have her walk through the water first and get her to learn how floating and water resistance feel.::
39662::$$$message_0272_0080_0000$$$::"Follow me, Saber.[lr]::
39663::$$$message_0272_0080_0001$$$::For starters, feel how heavy the water is and how much it pushes against your body[cacheimage storage=セイバーfd特殊01l(中)][wvl][playstop time=100 nowait=1][se storage=se589.wav][wait canskip=0 time=400][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 left=-310 top=79 time=350 accel=0 storage=セイバーfd特殊01l(中)][wait canskip=0 time=200][se storage=se196.wav][se storage=se608.wav][se storage=se160.wav][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 left=500 top=-13 time=600 accel=-4 layer=2][wait canskip=0 time=90][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 left=285 top=-13 time=600 accel=-4 layer=3][wait canskip=0 time=90][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 left=114 top=-13 time=600 accel=-4 layer=4][wait canskip=0 time=90][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 left=-124 top=-13 time=600 accel=-4 layer=5]..."[lr]::
39664::$$$message_0272_0080_0002$$$::[font italic=true]...Wait.[font italic=false][lr]::
39665::$$$message_0272_0080_0003$$$::[font italic=true]Was that a gust of wind?[font italic=false]::
39666::$$$message_0272_0081_0000$$$::"Ah. I see, this is certainly harder to walk on than the ground.[lr]::
39667::$$$message_0272_0081_0001$$$::But this is no problem. The weight of water should not be a struggle once I get the hang of it.[lr]::
39668::$$$message_0272_0081_0002$$$::Living beings return to the water after all, you know?"::
39669::$$$message_0272_0082_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
39670::$$$message_0272_0082_0001$$$::No, I [font italic=true]don't[font italic=false] know.[lr]::
39671::$$$message_0272_0082_0002$$$::Saber is smiling proudly.[lr]::
39672::$$$message_0272_0082_0003$$$::She has no fear during her first time in the water and walks across without difficulty, faster than me and almost at running speed. It's as if she doesn't even need to swim.[lr]::
39673::$$$message_0272_0082_0004$$$::...Apparently, she is able to predict an easier flow or path, so it is not that much of a struggle.::
39674::$$$message_0272_0083_0000$$$::"...I see. [flicker time=600 count=1]So all-rounders stop the progress of others at times."::
39675::$$$message_0272_0084_0000$$$::"Shirou...? W-what are you glaring at me for? I was simply moving forward in a way that felt natural to me."[lr]::
39676::$$$message_0272_0084_0001$$$::"That's what's wrong. I'm used to your nonsense, but I think that was beyond the pale."[lr]::
39677::$$$message_0272_0084_0002$$$::Birds naturally fly in the sky.[lr]::
39678::$$$message_0272_0084_0003$$$::So, I'll pluck those feathers out first.::
39679::$$$message_0272_0085_0000$$$::"H-huh...? Shirou...?[lr]::
39680::$$$message_0272_0085_0001$$$::What are those hand movements? It's just like that killer robot that we saw last night...!"[lr]::
39681::$$$message_0272_0085_0002$$$::I'll put her on the hardest course.[lr]::
39682::$$$message_0272_0085_0003$$$::I will try my best as the representative of ordinary people who can't have it their way.::
39683::$$$message_0272_0086_0000$$$::"H-hold on, I took it a bit too far; I apologize! [cacheimage storage=セイバーfd特殊01j(中),o新都_室内プール02(モブ)-(昼)][wvl canskip=0 time=500][clfg][fg left=287 index=2000 top=99 storage=セイバーfd特殊01j(中)][fg left=0 index=1000 top=0 storage=o新都_室内プール02(モブ)-(昼)][dash textoff=0 page=back mx=0 opacity=255 layer=all irot=0.031 cx=400 imag=1.8 time=100 cy=300 mag=1.8 my=0 rot=0.031 accel=0][se storage=se552.wav][transex textoff=0 time=200]Yes, it was immature of me to run on the water to try to surprise you![lr]::
39684::$$$message_0272_0086_0001$$$::I will earnestly and sincerely take your lessons[line len=2][cacheimage storage=white][wvl][se storage=se083.wav][se storage=se552.wav][sestop storage=se195.wav time=300 nowait=1][fadein textoff=0 time=300 rule=走る感じ(上から) storage=white]Ah!?"[lr]::
39685::$$$message_0272_0086_0002$$$::Yay, I was able to get on her!::
39686::$$$message_0272_0087_0000$$$::"!?!?!?[lr]::
39687::$$$message_0272_0087_0001$$$::Shirou, m-my legs aren't touching the grou[line len=2]!?!?!?"[lr]::
39688::$$$message_0272_0087_0002$$$::Saber struggles in the water, flutter-kicking her legs.[lr]::
39689::$$$message_0272_0087_0003$$$::She hangs on with her petite body, and [se storage=se552.wav]I drive the fear of water into her. [lr]::
39690::$$$message_0272_0087_0004$$$::All right.[lr]::
39691::$$$message_0272_0087_0005$$$::Now I'll just make this almighty supergirl slowly get a taste of the fun of working hard.::
39692::$$$message_0272_0088_0000$$$::"Come on, Saber. Lift your butt up more and relax the tension from your stomach."[lr]::
39693::$$$message_0272_0088_0001$$$::"B-but, Shirou! I am going to sink if I do that, aren't I!?"::
39694::$$$message_0272_0089_0000$$$::Saber struggles violently.[lr]::
39695::$$$message_0272_0089_0001$$$::Rather than sinking, Submarine Saber is flooding at a breakneck speed.[lr]::
39696::$$$message_0272_0089_0002$$$::If I let go of this hand, she will easily get crushed. May God have mercy.::
39697::$$$message_0272_0090_0000$$$::"Glrb, pull me up more, Shirou![lr]::
39698::$$$message_0272_0090_0001$$$::The human body is not made to be able to float!"[lr]::
39699::$$$message_0272_0090_0002$$$::"That depends on one's ability. It's all up to the amount of effort you put in.[lr]::
39700::$$$message_0272_0090_0003$$$::Human bodies can actually float quite well. Also, living beings return to water."[lr]::
39701::$$$message_0272_0090_0004$$$::"Glrb glrb...! I can't believe it! I wonder who said such a feckless thing...!"::
39702::$$$message_0272_0091_0000$$$::...She must be incompatible with water, or rather, maybe she's the type of person who always needs to fight against something until the end?[lr]::
39703::$$$message_0272_0091_0001$$$::Saber is fighting against the current with only her strength.[lr]::
39704::$$$message_0272_0091_0002$$$::She's trying to stay above the water only by flailing about, and her toned legs are going nowhere.[lr]::
39705::$$$message_0272_0091_0003$$$::Her flutter kick disturbs the peaceful surface of the water, just like a bulldozer digging up a clod of earth. ::
39706::$$$message_0272_0092_0000$$$::"Mm, good for you Saber.[lr]::
39707::$$$message_0272_0092_0001$$$::Good thing Illya isn't here today."[lr]::
39708::$$$message_0272_0092_0002$$$::Her theme song is a poem about drowning.[lr]::
39709::$$$message_0272_0092_0003$$$::She must have cursed Saber with her song, just like Lorelei.::
39710::$$$message_0272_0093_0000$$$::"Shirou, please stop, the water is dangerous...! We should not have gone out to sea after all...!"[lr]::
39711::$$$message_0272_0093_0001$$$::"The sea is a little easier to float in. I'm gonna slowly let go of your hand."[lr]::
39712::$$$message_0272_0093_0002$$$::"Glrb...!?!?!?"::
39713::$$$message_0272_0094_0000$$$::Saber starts sinking in a spectacular fashion.[lr]::
39714::$$$message_0272_0094_0001$$$::Floating in water and swimming must be two different things.[lr]::
39715::$$$message_0272_0094_0002$$$::No matter how athletic you are, there's no way to demonstrate how to just float.::
39716::$$$message_0272_0095_0000$$$::"Oh. No, Saber. You can't put your feet on the ground. Stop kicking and relax."[lr]::
39717::$$$message_0272_0095_0001$$$::"I-I already am relaxed! I think that I would sink even more if I stopped my legs!"[lr]::
39718::$$$message_0272_0095_0002$$$::"That's because you're still tensed up. Hmm... Let's see, you can pretend like you're dead. You'll definitely float if you do that."[lr]::
39719::$$$message_0272_0095_0003$$$::After all, you don't have to use any extra energy.::
39720::$$$message_0272_0096_0000$$$::"A-a drowned body? ...That is something that I would never do as a knight, but it is the first step to swimming, correct?"[lr]::
39721::$$$message_0272_0096_0001$$$::"For some people, yes. See, I'm holding onto your hand. Trust me."[lr]::
39722::$$$message_0272_0096_0002$$$::"Mrgh... V-very well; my heart is in my mouth either way. Please resuscitate me when I drown, Shirou...!"::
39723::$$$message_0272_0097_0000$$$::...And...[lr]::
39724::$$$message_0272_0097_0001$$$::To explain what happened after that...::
39725::$$$message_0272_0098_0000$$$::"I-I see, so you can float like this, Shirou?"[lr]::
39726::$$$message_0272_0098_0001$$$::The sound of splashing water.[lr]::
39727::$$$message_0272_0098_0002$$$::Saber is flustered but gets used to the water at a rapid speed.[lr]::
39728::$$$message_0272_0098_0003$$$::Her kick is still clumsy, but it seems like she's completely grasped how to not tense up.::
39729::$$$message_0272_0099_0000$$$::"That's right, you're doing well, Saber. You'll be able to swim on your own soon at this rate[line len=2]"[lr]::
39730::$$$message_0272_0099_0001$$$::"H-hold on, it is too early for that, Shirou...![lr]::
39731::$$$message_0272_0099_0002$$$::Can you please walk slowly? As if you're ambling around instead of walking."::
39732::$$$message_0272_0100_0000$$$::Saber grabs me, as if she's about to cling onto me.[lr]::
39733::$$$message_0272_0100_0001$$$::She's pretty much swimming on her own already, but she won't let go of my arm.::
39734::$$$message_0272_0101_0000$$$::"Hnng... Wait, no...in short, it is about balance and breathing. Yes, just as you said, I can stay afloat if I keep on breathing."::
39735::$$$message_0272_0102_0000$$$::Saber moves forward.[lr]::
39736::$$$message_0272_0102_0001$$$::I match her movement and also slowly back up.[lr]::
39737::$$$message_0272_0102_0002$$$::...Is it because Saber's hair is blond?[lr]::
39738::$$$message_0272_0102_0003$$$::I feel like I'm being depended on by a newborn chick.::
39739::$$$message_0272_0103_0000$$$::"Heave ho...!"[lr]::
39740::$$$message_0272_0103_0001$$$::Saber's legs move smoothly.[lr]::
39741::$$$message_0272_0103_0002$$$::Two sticks that were only slapping water turn into a fish tail and fins.::
39742::$$$message_0272_0104_0000$$$::"It is a different feeling from kicking the ground... Is this what kicking water is like? ...[cacheimage storage=fd17e(エフェクト多),fd17e][wvl][clfg][fg left=0 index=1000 top=0 storage=fd17e(エフェクト多)][stopmove][loopmove textoff=0 both=1 time=10000 path=(0,0,255,1000)(0,0,128,1000)(0,0,64,1000)(0,0,0,1000)(0,0,255,1000)(0,0,0,1000)(0,0,0,1000)(0,0,0,1000)(0,0,255,1000)(0,0,128,1000)(0,0,0,1000)(0,0,255,1000)(0,0,0,1000)(0,0,255,1000)(0,0,128,1000)(0,0,64,1000)(0,0,0,1000)(0,0,255,1000)(0,0,128,1000)(0,0,0,1000)(0,0,0,1000)(0,0,0,1000)(0,0,255,1000)(0,0,128,1000)(0,0,64,1000)(0,0,0,1000)(0,0,255,1000)(0,0,0,1000)(0,0,255,1000)(0,0,0,1000)(0,0,255,1000)(0,0,0,1000)(0,0,255,1000)(0,0,128,1000)(0,0,64,1000)(0,0,0,1000)(0,0,0,1000)(0,0,0,1000)(0,0,0,1000)(0,0,0,1000)(0,0,255,1000)(0,0,0,1000)(0,0,255,1000)(0,0,128,1000)(0,0,0,1000)(0,0,255,1000)(0,0,0,1000)(0,0,255,1000)(0,0,0,1000) page=back mover=RestiveMover storage=fd17e(エフェクト多) accel=1 frame=1 decel=2 spline=0][fadein textoff=0 time=300 storage=fd17e noclear=1]I understand the logic, but am I not cut out for this after all?"[lr]::
39743::$$$message_0272_0104_0001$$$::Saber is improving by the second, but she still doesn't let go of my hand.[lr]::
39744::$$$message_0272_0104_0002$$$::Saber's personality is austere and vigorous. Even if she's able to swim, I'm sure she still hasn't gotten used to the sensation of floating.::
39745::$$$message_0272_0105_0000$$$::"Saber, can I walk?"[lr]::
39746::$$$message_0272_0105_0001$$$::"Y-yes, you may, Shirou. I do not mind if you speed up a bit more than before."::
39747::$$$message_0272_0106_0000$$$::She's diligent until the very end.[lr]::
39748::$$$message_0272_0106_0001$$$::She's challenging herself even while being scared, trying to master swimming as fast as she can.[lr]::
39749::$$$message_0272_0106_0002$$$::What an excellent student. There's no room for any evil thoughts, and there's nothing more pleasing as her teacher.[lr]::
39750::$$$message_0272_0106_0003$$$::However...::
39751::$$$message_0272_0107_0000$$$::No matter how earnest her attitude towards swimming may be...[lr]::
39752::$$$message_0272_0107_0001$$$::Saber's body is evoking evil thoughts without anything to do with it.::
39753::$$$message_0272_0108_0000$$$::I hold my breath and gaze at Saber.[lr]::
39754::$$$message_0272_0108_0001$$$::My face would turn too hot if I looked straight at her, so I do my best to idly gaze at her well-proportioned body.::
39755::$$$message_0272_0109_0000$$$::"...Hrrk."[lr]::
39756::$$$message_0272_0109_0001$$$::I feel dizzy from how bright her white skin is.[lr]::
39757::$$$message_0272_0109_0002$$$::Her body, which looks smooth and soft, looks like it would feel good just hugging it.[lr]::
39758::$$$message_0272_0109_0003$$$::...To be honest, I would've hugged her without question if we weren't at the pool.::
39759::$$$message_0272_0110_0000$$$::"Hm? Shirou, your feet have stopped."[lr]::
39760::$$$message_0272_0110_0001$$$::Saber flutters her legs.[lr]::
39761::$$$message_0272_0110_0002$$$::Either she wants to get better faster, or she wants to test herself as she's getting used to it.[lr]::
39762::$$$message_0272_0110_0003$$$::Either way, the voice urging me to move forward is so earnest that it erases my evil thoughts.::
39763::$$$message_0272_0111_0000$$$::"Sorry, I was spacing out. You're getting used to it, so I'm going to pull a bit faster."[lr]::
39764::$$$message_0272_0111_0001$$$::It seems like she can swim about ten, no, twenty-five meters now, but I'll devote myself to leading her until she gains confidence.[lr]::
39765::$$$message_0272_0111_0002$$$::The day has just started. We have plenty of opportunities to swim with the two of us after this.::
39766::$$$message_0272_0112_0000$$$::"Oh, it seems like I'm more stable when I am moving faster. Floating is harder than swimming for me, Shirou."::
39767::$$$message_0272_0113_0000$$$::Saber must be embarrassed about that, as her voice doesn't have any strength in it.[lr]::
39768::$$$message_0272_0113_0001$$$::But... Even if she can swim this much, floating is still harder?[lr]::
39769::$$$message_0272_0113_0002$$$::Saber would be better at diving... And just as I think that,[lr]::
39770::$$$message_0272_0113_0003$$$::I imagine Saber walking upright at the bottom of the ocean.::
39771::$$$message_0272_0114_0000$$$::"Ha, that fits her too well."[lr]::
39772::$$$message_0272_0114_0001$$$::I suppress my laughter so that Saber doesn't notice.[lr]::
39773::$$$message_0272_0114_0002$$$::"Shirou...? Is my form weird?"::
39774::$$$message_0272_0115_0000$$$::"Oh, no, your swimming isn't weird. I was just thinking of why you can't float well."[lr]::
39775::$$$message_0272_0115_0001$$$::"Hm...? Is there a reason that I cannot float well...?"::
39776::$$$message_0272_0116_0000$$$::"Mm. According to one theory, muscles don't float well.[lr]::
39777::$$$message_0272_0116_0001$$$::You don't have any extra fat, right, Saber? I was wondering if that's why you float less than the average person."[lr]::
39778::$$$message_0272_0116_0002$$$::"I-Is that true? I was causing you trouble without realizing it... So, you prefer more feminine bodies[line len=2]"::
39779::$$$message_0272_0117_0000$$$::"But, that's only a small difference. It shouldn't be a handicap for you.[lr]::
39780::$$$message_0272_0117_0001$$$::Your body is like a well-made sculpture. I can see that even more clearly now in a place like this. I have no complaints about how cool your body looks when you're moving so gracefully."[lr]::
39781::$$$message_0272_0117_0002$$$::"..."::
39782::$$$message_0272_0118_0000$$$::"Wait, you're sinking, Saber! R-relax!"[lr]::
39783::$$$message_0272_0118_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
39784::$$$message_0272_0118_0002$$$::My warnings are futile, as Saber keeps on sinking.[lr]::
39785::$$$message_0272_0118_0003$$$::After this, Saber would not come back up to the surface and stayed underwater for a record time of nearly six minutes.::
39786::$$$message_0272_0119_0000$$$::It's been an hour since we started practicing...[lr]::
39787::$$$message_0272_0119_0001$$$::Saber has completely grown into a full-fledged swimmer, and it's not even noon.[lr]::
39788::$$$message_0272_0119_0002$$$::I'm not all that good at swimming either, but I can only say that it's just like Saber to learn how to swim as well as me.::
39789::$$$message_0272_0120_0000$$$::"...It's almost noon.[lr]::
39790::$$$message_0272_0120_0001$$$::Saber, do you wanna take a break?"[lr]::
39791::$$$message_0272_0120_0002$$$::"Yes, this is perfect timing, so we shall have lunch first."[lr]::
39792::$$$message_0272_0120_0003$$$::"Okay. I'll go get our lunch, so can you save us seats somewhere?"[lr]::
39793::$$$message_0272_0120_0004$$$::"Understood. I will be waiting, Shirou."::
39794::$$$message_0272_0121_0000$$$::I get our lunch from my locker and go back to the pool.[lr]::
39795::$$$message_0272_0121_0001$$$::Saber stands out even from afar, so I found her right away, but...it was thoughtless of me.[lr]::
39796::$$$message_0272_0121_0002$$$::She's pretty, stands out, and is alone, so of course it's easy for her to get involved in trouble.::
39797::$$$message_0272_0122_0000$$$::"I'm back, Saber... Did any weird guys talk to you?"[lr]::
39798::$$$message_0272_0122_0001$$$::"They did.[lr]::
39799::$$$message_0272_0122_0002$$$::They all left once they found out that I am not alone, but there was one unreasonable person. It is not like I allowed him to, but he sat in your seat."::
39800::$$$message_0272_0123_0000$$$::"Mrgh. What happened to him?"[lr]::
39801::$$$message_0272_0123_0001$$$::If he's not here, does that mean he's soaking somewhere in the pool right now?::
39802::$$$message_0272_0124_0000$$$::"No, some different man came and took him away... Um, I feel like the man who came later looked familiar."[lr]::
39803::$$$message_0272_0124_0001$$$::"...I see. I wonder if he helped because he was an acquaintance of yours."::
39804::$$$message_0272_0125_0000$$$::"That is possible. I would like to thank him if we find out his identity."[lr]::
39805::$$$message_0272_0125_0001$$$::"Yeah. I need to thank him too."::
39806::$$$message_0272_0126_0000$$$::I collect myself and open our lunch boxes.[lr]::
39807::$$$message_0272_0126_0001$$$::The main course is spring rolls and sushi, as well as some side dishes. I prepared plastic containers full of bite-size Japanese fried chicken, and hash browns.[lr]::
39808::$$$message_0272_0126_0002$$$::The inconsistent mixture of Japanese and Western food together is what makes it charming.::
39809::$$$message_0272_0127_0000$$$::"I thought of buying something around here since we came all this way, but...[lr]::
39810::$$$message_0272_0127_0001$$$::I didn't know what was going to happen, so I tried to cut expenses."::
39811::$$$message_0272_0128_0000$$$::"I do not understand 'cut expenses,' but I agree with this course of action.[lr]::
39812::$$$message_0272_0128_0001$$$::The food at the stands looks interesting, but I am more at ease with your food."::
39813::$$$message_0272_0129_0000$$$::"Oh... That makes it worth it then.[lr]::
39814::$$$message_0272_0129_0001$$$::But the food here is good too. Freshness is an important factor of food too."[lr]::
39815::$$$message_0272_0129_0002$$$::"Yes. However, your lunch is the best to me."::
39816::$$$message_0272_0130_0000$$$::"Ah... Well, um[line len=2]"[lr]::
39817::$$$message_0272_0130_0001$$$::Hold on, calm down.[lr]::
39818::$$$message_0272_0130_0002$$$::If I'm admiring Saber here, that defeats the purpose of coming to the pool in the first place.[lr]::
39819::$$$message_0272_0130_0003$$$::I need to stay calm and spend my day off with Saber.::
39820::$$$message_0272_0131_0000$$$::"W-well then, eat up. B-but, we're having dessert at that shaved ice place, Saber!"[lr]::
39821::$$$message_0272_0131_0001$$$::I point at the matcha shaved ice poster that I saw on the way to the locker room.::
39822::$$$message_0272_0132_0000$$$::"Yes. Let us eat then."[lr]::
39823::$$$message_0272_0132_0001$$$::"Yeah, bon appétit."::
39824::$$$message_0272_0133_0000$$$::We put our hands together. I secretly take a deep breath, and split my chopsticks.[lr]::
39825::$$$message_0272_0133_0001$$$::Then...a hand appears from the side and steals a slice of rolled omelet.::
39826::$$$message_0272_0134_0000$$$::"It's too salty. It's also not cooked enough. If you keep in mind that it's a packed lunch and cook it a bit longer, you'll be better able to maintain the flavor."::
39827::$$$message_0272_0135_0000$$$::"What..."[lr]::
39828::$$$message_0272_0135_0001$$$::I can't believe it. At Waku Waku Zabuun, where it seems as if only happy couples are allowed inside, why is there...::
39829::$$$message_0272_0136_0000$$$::"Archer!?[lr]::
39830::$$$message_0272_0136_0001$$$::Nonsense; why did you steal my rolled omelet...!?"[lr]::
39831::$$$message_0272_0136_0002$$$::...Oh, so you're more surprised about that, Saber.::
39832::$$$message_0272_0137_0000$$$::"You're used to people testing food for you, right? Even if it's autumn, you need to be careful about the freshness of eggs.[lr]::
39833::$$$message_0272_0137_0001$$$::Well, you know. Say you upset your stomach in a place like this. That would be so intense that I wouldn't even be able to look you in the eye.[lr]::
39834::$$$message_0272_0137_0002$$$::You'd also be in an awkward spot if I started laughing out loud in your presence, right?"::
39835::$$$message_0272_0138_0000$$$::"Wha... Are you saying that Shirou's food is spoiled?[lr]::
39836::$$$message_0272_0138_0001$$$::Don't insult me, Archer. I will not get sick over something that is only two or three days past the expiration date!"[lr]::
39837::$$$message_0272_0138_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
39838::$$$message_0272_0138_0003$$$::...Oh, so you're mad about that, Saber.::
39839::$$$message_0272_0139_0000$$$::"...Hey. Why are you here?"[lr]::
39840::$$$message_0272_0139_0001$$$::"I do not need any reason.[lr]::
39841::$$$message_0272_0139_0002$$$::This is a public place. I don't think it's strange at all that I'm here."[lr]::
39842::$$$message_0272_0139_0003$$$::It is strange. It's super strange. I can't believe I'm the one saying this, but you should notice how out of place you are, you fool.::
39843::$$$message_0272_0140_0000$$$::"...Well, sure, but did you actually pay?"[lr]::
39844::$$$message_0272_0140_0001$$$::"Of course. There's no such unrefined thing as swimming in spirit form."[lr]::
39845::$$$message_0272_0140_0002$$$::"...I see. So what, is that outfit supposed to be a swimsuit?"::
39846::$$$message_0272_0141_0000$$$::Archer doesn't answer.[lr]::
39847::$$$message_0272_0141_0001$$$::Archer, who takes off his red coat and is in his undergarments, could argue that it's a diving suit.[lr]::
39848::$$$message_0272_0141_0002$$$::But he seems to have some sort of reason for wearing that outfit.[lr]::
39849::$$$message_0272_0141_0003$$$::...Well, it doesn't matter to me.::
39850::$$$message_0272_0142_0000$$$::"Wha!? A new villain!?"[lr]::
39851::$$$message_0272_0142_0001$$$::"Mm, hey, this is super good.[lr]::
39852::$$$message_0272_0142_0002$$$::You're so nitpicky, man. You're asking for too much."[lr]::
39853::$$$message_0272_0142_0003$$$::He says, while chewing.[lr]::
39854::$$$message_0272_0142_0004$$$::The aloha guy eats our lunch as if it's natural.::
39855::$$$message_0272_0143_0000$$$::"Yo, Saber. You were being approached by some weirdo earlier."[lr]::
39856::$$$message_0272_0143_0001$$$::"Lancer... So it was you who saved me.[lr]::
39857::$$$message_0272_0143_0002$$$::...Why are you here?"::
39858::$$$message_0272_0144_0000$$$::"Huh, why? 'Cause I saw you guys going inside. Unlike that guy with a lot of time on his hands, I'm not crazy enough to come hang by myself."::
39859::$$$message_0272_0145_0000$$$::Lancer is eating away at our lunch.[lr]::
39860::$$$message_0272_0145_0001$$$::Saber and I are taken aback. Archer calmly observes us.[lr]::
39861::$$$message_0272_0145_0002$$$::...It seems like that happy atmosphere from before has flown far beyond the cumulonimbus clouds.::
39862::$$$message_0272_0146_0000$$$::"Hey, your food is pretty good, boy. Oh? What's up with you two? Are you not gonna eat? Your chopsticks aren't moving."[lr]::
39863::$$$message_0272_0146_0001$$$::"...So. Why are you eating it like it's yours?"::
39864::$$$message_0272_0147_0000$$$::"Why? It's a valid reward. I helped Saber out... Well, the compensation is rather shabby considering the treasure I protected."[lr]::
39865::$$$message_0272_0147_0001$$$::He eats away.[lr]::
39866::$$$message_0272_0147_0002$$$::Lancer devours the self-proclaimed shabby compensation.[lr]::
39867::$$$message_0272_0147_0003$$$::Saber and I are at a loss for words at the tyranny and the certain level of validity in his argument.::
39868::$$$message_0272_0148_0000$$$::"Oh... No, there is still something called manners, Lancer![lr]::
39869::$$$message_0272_0148_0001$$$::Also, please be aware that I will mercilessly hammer you if you get ahold of my sushi roll."::
39870::$$$message_0272_0149_0000$$$::"'Hammer me'? You mean, into the pool?"[lr]::
39871::$$$message_0272_0149_0001$$$::Lancer smirks, amused.[lr]::
39872::$$$message_0272_0149_0002$$$::"No, with Excalibur."[lr]::
39873::$$$message_0272_0149_0003$$$::Saber smiles, also amused.::
39874::$$$message_0272_0150_0000$$$::"...Well, I should eat in moderation."[lr]::
39875::$$$message_0272_0150_0001$$$::Lancer quickly retreats from our lunch. Good decision.[lr]::
39876::$$$message_0272_0150_0002$$$::I don't know about Archer and Lancer, but only I know that Saber was pretty serious.::
39877::$$$message_0272_0151_0000$$$::"So, enough joking around..."[lr]::
39878::$$$message_0272_0151_0001$$$::Lancer intensely observes Saber.[lr]::
39879::$$$message_0272_0151_0002$$$::"W-what is it?"[lr]::
39880::$$$message_0272_0151_0003$$$::He looks her up and down, but his gaze isn't unpleasant; it's as if he's looking at an opponent before battle.::
39881::$$$message_0272_0152_0000$$$::He nods.[lr]::
39882::$$$message_0272_0152_0001$$$::"Is that the swimsuit the boy wanted you to wear?"[lr]::
39883::$$$message_0272_0152_0002$$$::"No, Saber chose it herself and bought it."[lr]::
39884::$$$message_0272_0152_0003$$$::"Shirou!"::
39885::$$$message_0272_0153_0000$$$::"I see, I see. But that's even worse, Saber.[lr]::
39886::$$$message_0272_0153_0001$$$::Look, I'll teach you one thing. You're supposed to wear swimsuits like that once you become a mature wom[line len=2]"[lr]::
39887::$$$message_0272_0153_0002$$$::Before Lancer finishes that thought, he disappears from my sight.::
39888::$$$message_0272_0154_0000$$$::"...That was fast."[lr]::
39889::$$$message_0272_0154_0001$$$::Archer murmurs, while I'm trying to process what just happened.[lr]::
39890::$$$message_0272_0154_0002$$$::"Shirou, I will be right back. I would appreciate it if you could leave me some food."::
39891::$$$message_0272_0155_0000$$$::"Uh, [shock vmax=20 time=300 count=2]okay."[lr]::
39892::$$$message_0272_0155_0001$$$::I can only nod.[lr]::
39893::$$$message_0272_0155_0002$$$::Saber goes over to Lancer, who was blasted away.[lr]::
39894::$$$message_0272_0155_0003$$$::...How frightening. Was that one attack not enough?::
39895::$$$message_0272_0156_0000$$$::"He really incurred her wrath. Were there any anecdotes of slaying dragons in her lore?"[lr]::
39896::$$$message_0272_0156_0001$$$::"...Don't eat our lunch while talking. If you have complaints about how it tastes, then make it yourself."[lr]::
39897::$$$message_0272_0156_0002$$$::"I don't have that much time on my hands, and cooking is your territory, right? It's your only strength; it is not my place to stand out."[lr]::
39898::$$$message_0272_0156_0003$$$::Archer laughs.[lr]::
39899::$$$message_0272_0156_0004$$$::Ugh, I knew I hated this guy.::
39900::$$$message_0272_0157_0000$$$::On another note, it seems to be lively over there too.[lr]::
39901::$$$message_0272_0157_0001$$$::A waterspout rises with a splash.[lr]::
39902::$$$message_0272_0157_0002$$$::Saber flings Lancer, who is saying something, with one hand.::
39903::$$$message_0272_0158_0000$$$::"...I didn't know people could fly that high."[lr]::
39904::$$$message_0272_0158_0001$$$::Thinking back, I also flew quite a lot when Lancer kicked me away.::
39905::$$$message_0272_0159_0000$$$::"Saber is serious. There is no kindness in her throw[line len=2]Mrgh.[lr]::
39906::$$$message_0272_0159_0001$$$::Hey, your cooked food has lost too much of its taste. If you're going to put in star anise, be careful about the timing."[lr]::
39907::$$$message_0272_0159_0002$$$::And who is this guy who keeps on nitpicking about my cooking?::
39908::$$$message_0272_0160_0000$$$::"Wait, now's not the time for that. I have to stop Saber."[lr]::
39909::$$$message_0272_0160_0001$$$::"Quit it. It will end soon; are you trying to get involved again by going near them?"[lr]::
39910::$$$message_0272_0160_0002$$$::"...Mrgh. It doesn't seem like it'll end anytime soon, though."::
39911::$$$message_0272_0161_0000$$$::"Saber just learned how to swim, right?[lr]::
39912::$$$message_0272_0161_0001$$$::She won't be able to catch up to Lancer, who has crazy endurance. Lancer will run away and it will end."[lr]::
39913::$$$message_0272_0161_0002$$$::"...Were you watching?"[lr]::
39914::$$$message_0272_0161_0003$$$::"It just happened to get in my view. As you know, I have good eyes... [cacheimage storage=アーチャー袖無し03f(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=アーチャー袖無し03f(中)]Wait, what?"::
39915::$$$message_0272_0162_0000$$$::Archer's face stiffens.[lr]::
39916::$$$message_0272_0162_0001$$$::...Guh.[lr]::
39917::$$$message_0272_0162_0002$$$::Lancer has disappeared in front of Saber by free diving.[lr]::
39918::$$$message_0272_0162_0003$$$::But, in that direction...[lr]::
39919::$$$message_0272_0162_0004$$$::Saber is running on the water like a jet ski and chasing after him!::
39920::$$$message_0272_0163_0000$$$::"Eeeeek...!!!"[lr]::
39921::$$$message_0272_0163_0001$$$::That is not good.[lr]::
39922::$$$message_0272_0163_0002$$$::I hear some screams by the poolside too.::
39923::$$$message_0272_0164_0000$$$::"...She's out of her mind. Is she trying to kill Lancer?"[lr]::
39924::$$$message_0272_0164_0001$$$::"That's seriously bad! Dammit, stop acting so calm and help out too!"[lr]::
39925::$$$message_0272_0164_0002$$$::I run to the pool.[lr]::
39926::$$$message_0272_0164_0003$$$::S-Saber will get taken away by the police...!::
39927::$$$message_0272_0165_0000$$$::"I am sorry, Shirou..."[lr]::
39928::$$$message_0272_0165_0001$$$::Fortunately, the waterspout was right under the diving board, so I was able to stop the two[line len=2]well, more like Saber[line len=2]before it became a real commotion.::
39929::$$$message_0272_0166_0000$$$::"...Please think about what you did. Lancer is the one most at fault here, but you're also at fault for losing control."[lr]::
39930::$$$message_0272_0166_0001$$$::Saber cowers, ashamed of herself.[lr]::
39931::$$$message_0272_0166_0002$$$::She really regrets what she's done this time.[lr]::
39932::$$$message_0272_0166_0003$$$::After all, it was a big brawl in front of the general public at the water park where a lot of people have gathered.::
39933::$$$message_0272_0167_0000$$$::"But well, it's a good thing you beat Lancer up. He deserved that much at least."::
39934::$$$message_0272_0168_0000$$$::"I am glad...![lr]::
39935::$$$message_0272_0168_0001$$$::I felt refreshed when I hammered Lancer into the water from the ramp!"[lr]::
39936::$$$message_0272_0168_0002$$$::"Oh..."[lr]::
39937::$$$message_0272_0168_0003$$$::...I take back what I just said.[lr]::
39938::$$$message_0272_0168_0004$$$::Instead of really regretting it, she's only regretting it a little.::
39939::$$$message_0272_0169_0000$$$::"So, what happened to Lancer?"[lr]::
39940::$$$message_0272_0169_0001$$$::"Archer took him back, saying that he would bury him in the flower bed of the church or some such, heheheh."[lr]::
39941::$$$message_0272_0169_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
39942::$$$message_0272_0169_0003$$$::Let me assert this.[lr]::
39943::$$$message_0272_0169_0004$$$::Throwing him away at the church was Archer's idea, but the rest has to have been Saber's request.::
39944::$$$message_0272_0170_0000$$$::Archer will say later...[lr]::
39945::$$$message_0272_0170_0001$$$::It was not a request. It was a threat.[lr]::
39946::$$$message_0272_0170_0002$$$::Saber would have destroyed the entirety of Fuyuki if he hadn't complied or something.::
39947::$$$message_0272_0171_0000$$$::"All right, why don't we start practicing again?"[lr]::
39948::$$$message_0272_0171_0001$$$::"Okay, Shirou. But...is it all right?"[lr]::
39949::$$$message_0272_0171_0002$$$::"What is?"::
39950::$$$message_0272_0172_0000$$$::"Well, I have caused this much of a commotion. Would it not cause others trouble?"[lr]::
39951::$$$message_0272_0172_0001$$$::Oh yeah, a kid started crying from that fuss. It would be rough for Saber if they pointed at her saying, "Oh, it's that girl that was going crazy."::
39952::$$$message_0272_0173_0000$$$::"Hmm... Well, I don't think there's anything for you to worry about.[lr]::
39953::$$$message_0272_0173_0001$$$::Everyone is coming to have fun, so they're not bothered about what already happened, especially if it was entertaining."::
39954::$$$message_0272_0174_0000$$$::"...I see. I hope that is the case."[lr]::
39955::$$$message_0272_0174_0001$$$::"Yeah. Oh, or do you want to stop practicing and have some fun? I'm sure you'd be okay in any pool now. The wave pool is pretty fun, for starters."::
39956::$$$message_0272_0175_0000$$$::"No, the pool from earlier was plenty of fun, too![lr]::
39957::$$$message_0272_0175_0001$$$::...Besides, the other pools are crowded. You would not be able to lead me by the hand over there."[lr]::
39958::$$$message_0272_0175_0002$$$::Saber murmurs in a quiet, bashful voice.[lr]::
39959::$$$message_0272_0175_0003$$$::"..."[lr]::
39960::$$$message_0272_0175_0004$$$::...I would also rather be alone with Saber, too.::
39961::$$$message_0272_0176_0000$$$::"Got it. Why don't we start practicing again?"[lr]::
39962::$$$message_0272_0176_0001$$$::"Yes. I will improve more in the afternoon, Shirou."[lr]::
39963::$$$message_0272_0176_0002$$$::Saber happily walks over to the practice pool.[lr]::
39964::$$$message_0272_0176_0003$$$::Based on her progress in the morning, I'm sure she could move over to the pool used for competitions right away.::
39965::$$$message_0272_0177_0000$$$::Saber's progress from there on was tremendous.[lr]::
39966::$$$message_0272_0177_0001$$$::She finished swimming twenty-five meters, made an impressive crawl her own, and her turns were as clean as a swimming athlete's.::
39967::$$$message_0272_0178_0000$$$::"How am I doing, Shirou?[lr]::
39968::$$$message_0272_0178_0001$$$::I believe that there were less uncertain moments compared to this morning."[lr]::
39969::$$$message_0272_0178_0002$$$::"No, there's nothing uncertain. I have nothing else to teach you."::
39970::$$$message_0272_0179_0000$$$::"Then, I am fully proficient. I am glad. I can finally swim with you, Shirou."[lr]::
39971::$$$message_0272_0179_0001$$$::Well, she was able to swim well enough this morning, but...I guess this was what she was really aiming for.::
39972::$$$message_0272_0180_0000$$$::"I see. Then, let's compete, Saber.[lr]::
39973::$$$message_0272_0180_0001$$$::You've gotten that good; it would be boring just to swim, right?"[lr]::
39974::$$$message_0272_0180_0002$$$::"Yes. Competing with you sounds fun, too."::
39975::$$$message_0272_0181_0000$$$::Saber is excited for once.[lr]::
39976::$$$message_0272_0181_0001$$$::That makes me happy, and I get carried away and end up heading to the biggest pool for competitions.[lr]::
39977::$$$message_0272_0181_0002$$$::...Yes.[lr]::
39978::$$$message_0272_0181_0003$$$::I didn't realize that was the start of the second tragedy.::
39979::$$$message_0272_0182_0000$$$::"Shirou, are you okay?"[lr]::
39980::$$$message_0272_0182_0001$$$::"Y-yeah...somewhat...[smudge textoff=0 time=100 level=6]fine..."[lr]::
39981::$$$message_0272_0182_0002$$$::I answer while having spasms at the poolside.::
39982::$$$message_0272_0183_0000$$$::It's been an hour since then.[lr]::
39983::$$$message_0272_0183_0001$$$::My body is crying in agony all over, I've not only run out of stamina but broken straight through the bottom of my reserves, and I feel like something important has even been consumed as a result.[lr]::
39984::$$$message_0272_0183_0002$$$::The cause of this tragedy is my own lack of caution.[lr]::
39985::$$$message_0272_0183_0003$$$::I had won the first time competing against Saber without a second thought.[lr]::
39986::$$$message_0272_0183_0004$$$::I had completely forgotten that trait of hers: her obsession with competitions.::
39987::$$$message_0272_0184_0000$$$::"...Again. Let us compete one more time, Shirou."[lr]::
39988::$$$message_0272_0184_0001$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
39989::$$$message_0272_0184_0002$$$::By the time I realized the unsettling atmosphere, it was too late.::
39990::$$$message_0272_0185_0000$$$::"I said, let us compete one more time.[lr]::
39991::$$$message_0272_0185_0001$$$::I hear that sports matches cannot be decided by just one round. We should make it so that the first to win two out of three rounds wins for the sake of fairness." ::
39992::$$$message_0272_0186_0000$$$::...And that's how Saber challenged me to another match.[lr]::
39993::$$$message_0272_0186_0001$$$::Thus, the worst water race ever, where Saber increased her speed every match, started.[lr]::
39994::$$$message_0272_0186_0002$$$::The number of times that Saber lost until she beat me was fifteen times.[lr]::
39995::$$$message_0272_0186_0003$$$::That's three thousand meters in distance.[lr]::
39996::$$$message_0272_0186_0004$$$::And I had to lose the same amount of times without slacking off to calm Saber down...!::
39997::$$$message_0272_0187_0000$$$::"H-ah, ha...I won't ever...forget...that you're...a sore loser..."[lr]::
39998::$$$message_0272_0187_0001$$$::"W-what are you saying? That makes it sound like I am at fault."[lr]::
39999::$$$message_0272_0187_0002$$$::"Yeah... Heheh, it's my fault for forgetting..."::
40000::$$$message_0272_0188_0000$$$::...Oof, my muscles are so full of lactic acid that I can't even move a step.[lr]::
40001::$$$message_0272_0188_0001$$$::There's still time until sunset, but I can't go to the other pools like this.[lr]::
40002::$$$message_0272_0188_0002$$$::This is regretful, but jumping in the wave pool or competing on the slide will have to wait another day...::
40003::$$$message_0272_0189_0000$$$::Waku Waku Zabuun closes, and once the crowd dies down, we take our time going home.[lr]::
40004::$$$message_0272_0189_0001$$$::Even the midsummer sky is back to its hazy autumn color once we go outside.::
40005::$$$message_0272_0190_0000$$$::"Shirou, I am sorry about today.[lr]::
40006::$$$message_0272_0190_0001$$$::I ruined your day..."[lr]::
40007::$$$message_0272_0190_0002$$$::"Huh? What, you're still worried about that, Saber?"::
40008::$$$message_0272_0191_0000$$$::"Don't worry. Waku Waku Zabuun is open all year long. We can come again."[lr]::
40009::$$$message_0272_0191_0001$$$::"Y-yes, we still have opportunities.[lr]::
40010::$$$message_0272_0191_0002$$$::Please be assured, I will not make such a mistake next time.[lr]::
40011::$$$message_0272_0191_0003$$$::It may be late, but I was made keenly aware of my weaknesses from today's incident!"::
40012::$$$message_0272_0192_0000$$$::Saber is seriously reflecting on it.[lr]::
40013::$$$message_0272_0192_0001$$$::"Don't worry about it. Being a sore loser is your strength.[lr]::
40014::$$$message_0272_0192_0002$$$::...Oh... But, yeah. Try not to do what you did today."[lr]::
40015::$$$message_0272_0192_0003$$$::"Definitely. I believe it will take some time, but I shall fix it little by little!"::
40016::$$$message_0272_0193_0000$$$::Hahaha. Well, it's not something to laugh at, but it seems like today's incident has been traumatic for her.[lr]::
40017::$$$message_0272_0193_0001$$$::...If anything, that just shows how much this pool day meant to her.[lr]::
40018::$$$message_0272_0193_0002$$$::She had clothes saved just for today, and it was her first time at the pool.[lr]::
40019::$$$message_0272_0193_0003$$$::Just like how I was feeling nervous, Saber must've also been feeling the same.::
40020::$$$message_0272_0194_0000$$$::"...I see.[lr]::
40021::$$$message_0272_0194_0001$$$::But it was fun right, Saber?"[lr]::
40022::$$$message_0272_0194_0002$$$::"Yes.[lr]::
40023::$$$message_0272_0194_0003$$$::It was fun having you teach me and competing together."[lr]::
40024::$$$message_0272_0194_0004$$$::"Then it was the perfect pool day.[lr]::
40025::$$$message_0272_0194_0005$$$::You didn't ruin it. It'll be hard to find a day more fun than today anywhere."[cacheimage storage=セイバーfd特殊04a頬(中)][wvs][chgfg textoff=0 storage=セイバーfd特殊04a頬(中) time=300]::
40026::$$$message_0272_0195_0000$$$::The day ended like usual.[lr]::
40027::$$$message_0272_0195_0001$$$::Just like any other day, we walk to Miyama instead of taking the bus.[lr]::
40028::$$$message_0272_0195_0002$$$::Our man-made summer has come to an end.[lr]::
40029::$$$message_0272_0195_0003$$$::As we gaze at the dusk sky, Saber and I go across the bridge in the sunset.::
939542::$$$message_9272_0040_0000$$$::"...I am glad. If that is what you think, then I am not bothered by others looking."[r]:��N